.env
# Edge Function secrets (pushed with `supabase secrets set --env-file`)
supabase/functions/.env.secrets
# Generated one-shot rotation scripts. These hold live vault values by design;
# the tracked counterpart is migration 0026, which holds the procedure only.
supabase/rotate_secrets.local.sql
supabase/*.local.sql
# Supabase CLI local link state
supabase/.temp/
# NOTE: migrations are tracked as of Phase 18, by explicit choice. Until Phase
# 19 they also embedded live vault secret values in plaintext (0002, 0003,
# 0005, 0011, 0013) on a public repo. Those five secrets have now been rotated
# and the literals removed from the working tree AND from git history; the
# migrations carry __PLACEHOLDER__ tokens and migration 0026 documents the
# procedure. A migration must never again contain a secret value — if one needs
# rotating, generate a *.local.sql (ignored above) and keep the tracked file
# describing the mechanism only.

# Flutter/Dart
.dart_tool/
build/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# Category harness feed cache (`node tools/category_harness.mjs --cache`)
tools/.category_harness_cache.json

# Claude Code local state
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
